 "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036703_576173451444056_2815308939854354726_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4nTkwfXxRssQ7kNvwHqGHz2&_nc_oc=AdrH81snNQNtEA11VY6bF3vvs4rw0A7QddoKUNCOtRvfRYaORlNMBF0WodQngB2TCyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHZDgmNkZEiGxD7n4MFVU_1pqQSgLV_570osoGJpZb3g&oe=6AA16A68"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot D.png", "id": "480971648434463", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001662_480971655101129_6064421927720784354_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kE2cZEzG0jsQ7kNvwEvPwzk&_nc_oc=AdowabV1NrWdh-Kkav_ylcA2M0RIbbSfLAPZLpRTZydoKkYK0wBbh11t_q5b-JpItZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJOWSB6UQxByMTznwrzVx-DP1uzyrfS6j83AJ2NSBmopg&oe=6AA162C8"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot C.png", "id": "1683707145528823", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75508956_1683707148862156_8286553196679635241_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uBMduvaeYHQQ7kNvwFds0nY&_nc_oc=AdpysjrGGffPraq3ng_FmCJKqWmsoUq-USye0BcjsxnxtYv_MK3gg4RvzTvygRjgUto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJVrLNslXgKAygXU6jObpTmQQp2wx7kqfVIPBvoYyc93w&oe=6AA15854"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cues Landscape v2.png", "id": "1206096493787337", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_1206096497120670_6286030136535771041_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OcqTbXGEYxAQ7kNvwEFc3ar&_nc_oc=AdojLXvkuXYaWxxI_4_WkDHezkTNIftrmUk9xoOESKN-q_twnQNYF5OK8ndJr7EFgqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQITzj4NlKnRSsfaYWuLc9lZE0VpTdXM-50E5gLaomjh2Q&oe=6AA148FB"}, "display_name": "Cues", "keywords": ["brick", "breaker", "mixed", "hand", "magic"], "long_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with **Cues**. Dive into a **hand-tracking** experience where music meets motion. \n\n**NEW:** Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\n- \u201cIt looks amazing. One of the coolest looking MR games I\u2019ve seen\u201d \u2013 Matt BMFVR\n\n{557242276938737}\n\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a **dynamically evolving symphony** influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises.\n\nIdeal for brief, engaging sessions, 'Cues' converts any room into a vibrant arena of musical puzzles.\n", "short_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with Cues. Dive into a hand-tracking experience where music meets motion. \n\nNEW: Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a dynamically evolving symphony influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises."}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "PotamWorks SAS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua